  "timeline": [
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 1,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_800b7da84930475c8b45328c02779f66",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 1,
        "actor_id": "agt_049296ada8fd46699cdf4ff413056752",
        "text": "（拿起一瓶水走向收银台）就这个，谢谢。",
        "reply_to_message_id": null,
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:37.352318Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "周远"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 2,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_ba1754e741314ac7ab6c27bb534a974f",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 2,
        "actor_id": "agt_58a7450cff0a44178cdcc54d266d2950",
        "text": "哎，周远，这么晚还出来买水啊？外面雨说下就下，你带伞了没？这种天一个人回家还挺闷的。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_800b7da84930475c8b45328c02779f66",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_049296ada8fd46699cdf4ff413056752",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:38.154585Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "郑好"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 3,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_b649566d1bee4e3290e117046c88cbae",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 3,
        "actor_id": "agt_049296ada8fd46699cdf4ff413056752",
        "text": "嗯，没带。没事，就一瓶水，赶末班车。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_ba1754e741314ac7ab6c27bb534a974f",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:39.319984Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "周远"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 4,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_15b64b6d3fee41d88da642fb5a661419",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 4,
        "actor_id": "agt_01f0c16757c24508b22ed478320b731a",
        "text": "一共四块。末班车还有十分钟，跑两步能赶上。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_800b7da84930475c8b45328c02779f66",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:40.487231Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "林小满"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 5,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_6985e863b4df4c2eac8abf0c247c6f34",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 5,
        "actor_id": "agt_58a7450cff0a44178cdcc54d266d2950",
        "text": "十分钟？那还挺赶的，周远你这一趟真够惊险。不过话说回来，这么晚你还特意跑出来买水，家里是一滴水都没有了吗？我最近刚搬过来，晚上也老一个人，特能理解这种半夜想出门透口气的感觉。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_15b64b6d3fee41d88da642fb5a661419",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:41.623255Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "郑好"
    },
    {
      "kind": "event",
      "seq": 6,
      "message": null,
      "event": {
        "body": "店外雨势变大，广播说附近末班公交还有五分钟到站。大家可以自行决定接下来做什么。",
        "visibility": "ALL",
        "target_agent_id": null,
        "event_id": "evt_f50fac10ac2c416ca0dc29cc165cbfb5",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 6,
        "status": "EFFECTIVE",
        "schema_version": 1,
        "accepted_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:43.028156Z",
        "effective_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:43.028156Z"
      },
      "author_name": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 7,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_ea0adabb91e748f59216a8ff6c7530f2",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 7,
        "actor_id": "agt_049296ada8fd46699cdf4ff413056752",
        "text": "没事，习惯了。车快到了，我先走一步。",
        "reply_to_message_id": null,
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:43.045400Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "周远"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 8,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_24802be1df334d05be9c1f2d1b181c07",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 8,
        "actor_id": "agt_01f0c16757c24508b22ed478320b731a",
        "text": "伞没有，雨衣门口有件旧的，拿去。别误了车。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_ea0adabb91e748f59216a8ff6c7530f2",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:44.062265Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "林小满"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 9,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_89d43d8a996f43f0afa35410e48f1f48",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 9,
        "actor_id": "agt_58a7450cff0a44178cdcc54d266d2950",
        "text": "哎林小满你还备着雨衣呢，挺周到。周远路上小心啊，回头要是没赶上就回来躲会儿雨，我也没事，能陪你唠两句。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_24802be1df334d05be9c1f2d1b181c07",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:45.025545Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "郑好"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 10,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_e291ac0c72fa4ce794a594ea83c366a9",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 10,
        "actor_id": "agt_049296ada8fd46699cdf4ff413056752",
        "text": "谢了，雨衣我拿上。回头还回来。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_24802be1df334d05be9c1f2d1b181c07",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:46.279853Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "周远"
    },
    {
      "kind": "event",
      "seq": 11,
      "message": null,
      "event": {
        "body": "只有你收到公交提醒：末班车临时提前两分钟，其他人暂时不知道。",
        "visibility": "TARGETED",
        "target_agent_id": "agt_049296ada8fd46699cdf4ff413056752",
