      },
      "author_name": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 12,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_7baea2bb80a342cd8c84b50efc57c366",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 12,
        "actor_id": "agt_01f0c16757c24508b22ed478320b731a",
        "text": "雨衣不用急着还。末班车快到了，跑吧。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_e291ac0c72fa4ce794a594ea83c366a9",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:47.454632Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "林小满"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 13,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_3fdb947fc48f4f53a9f6048c15801385",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 13,
        "actor_id": "agt_58a7450cff0a44178cdcc54d266d2950",
        "text": "周远跑得真快。哎林小满，你这雨衣是哪来的呀？店里专门备的，还是你自己放的？我刚搬来这附近，什么都不熟，就想多知道点。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_7baea2bb80a342cd8c84b50efc57c366",
        "requested_speaker_id": "agt_01f0c16757c24508b22ed478320b731a",
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:48.353171Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "郑好"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 14,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_5e6865ee940a4a239be690445f47b840",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 14,
        "actor_id": "agt_01f0c16757c24508b22ed478320b731a",
        "text": "自己放的。上一件被拿走了没收回来。你要住附近，雨大就进来躲。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_3fdb947fc48f4f53a9f6048c15801385",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:49.426998Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "林小满"
    },
    {
      "kind": "message",
      "seq": 15,
      "message": {
        "message_id": "msg_ffbf3b59ee464ffa9e35cd3aeb6fd1ad",
        "scene_id": "scn_c7ae93a120774169ab22ed599d53135d",
        "seq": 15,
        "actor_id": "agt_049296ada8fd46699cdf4ff413056752",
        "text": "车提前了，我真得跑了。雨衣明后天还你，谢了。",
        "reply_to_message_id": "msg_24802be1df334d05be9c1f2d1b181c07",
        "requested_speaker_id": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-28T02:20:50.327859Z"
      },
      "event": null,
      "author_name": "周远"
    }
  ],
