      "action_id": "act_712568fa7ab74bbfb4e882085b1df0dd",
      "actor_id": "agt_049296ada8fd46699cdf4ff413056752",
      "status": "SUCCEEDED",
      "action": "SPEAK",
      "text": "车提前了，我真得跑了。雨衣明后天还你，谢了。",
